     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing how much of an action is done",
     "texto": [
      "To say someone did an action more or fewer times than another person, use **A 比 B 多/少 + verb + amount**: **我比他多看了一本书** = I read one more book than him. The amount goes after the verb.",
      "**得** can also mean «to obtain»; don't confuse it with the particle **得** you already know after a verb."
     ],
