    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The more, the more",
     "texto": [
      "**越……越……** means «the more…, the more…»: **你越努力，成绩越好** = the harder you work, the better your results. **变 + adjective** expresses a change; **变成 + noun** shows what something turns into."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
